THIRD-PARTY DATA

The MIT licence above covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT
cover the datasets, which are redistributed here under their own terms and
remain the property of their providers. Attribution as required by each:

  Landsat 8 Collection 2 Level 2 (surface reflectance and surface temperature)
    Courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey. Landsat data are in the public
    domain and free to redistribute with attribution.
    https://www.usgs.gov/landsat-missions

  ESA WorldCover v200 (land cover)
    © ESA WorldCover project 2021 / Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data.
    Licensed CC BY 4.0 -- redistribution permitted with attribution.
    https://esa-worldcover.org/

  geoBoundaries (administrative boundary of Guwahati)
    Runfola, D. et al. (2020) geoBoundaries: A global database of political
    administrative boundaries. Licensed CC BY 4.0.
    https://www.geoboundaries.org/

  OpenStreetMap / CARTO (basemap tiles used by the dashboard)
    © OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed ODbL. Tiles © CARTO.
    Tiles are fetched at runtime and are not redistributed in this repository.
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Derived products in this repository -- the grid dataset, the tiered
recommendations and the exported GeoJSON -- are computed from the sources above
and inherit their attribution requirements.

The cost and cooling figures are planning assumptions authored by the project
team, not third-party data, and are not fit for procurement. See
docs/08-limitations.md.
